# 🛒 E-Commerce SQL Analytics & Schema Project

An end-to-end relational database and analytics project modeling a real-world e-commerce platform. Built with MySQL, this project covers full schema design, data population, and transactional analysis to extract core business metrics like revenue, product performance, and customer spend.

---

## 📌 Features & Business Use Cases
* **Relational Schema Design:** Normalized database layout across 5 tables with explicit Primary and Foreign Keys.
* **Sales & Revenue Tracking:** Queries to calculate net revenue across payment methods and specific product lines.
* **Customer Behavior Analysis:** Identification of top-tier spending customers and order fulfillment rates.
* **Inventory & Order Operations:** Monitoring best-selling items, stock levels, and order cancellation metrics.

---

## 🗂️ Database Architecture

The schema represents an operational e-commerce flow:

```text
  [Customers] ────< [Orders] ────< [Payments]
                      │
                      └───< [Order_Items] >──── [Products]
